# Project Structure Guide
> **Note**: This is our fork of the Cython project, actively improved with additional features and fixes.

This repository contains both the Cython compiler itself and an embedded example of the `mproc` CLI:

- Core Cython compiler sources: [Cython/](mdc:Cython)
  - Compiler implementation in [Cython/Compiler/](mdc:Cython/Compiler)
  - Parser implementation in [Cython/Parser/](mdc:Cython/Parser)
  - Runtime support in [Cython/Runtime/](mdc:Cython/Runtime)
- Standalone build script: [build.py](mdc:build.py)
  - Sole entry point for compiling any `.pyx` into a standalone executable
  - Invoke:
    ```bash
    python build.py <source>.pyx
    ```
  - Automates embed, compilation, linking, and runtime path configuration across OS/arch
- Example embedding of the `mproc` CLI:
  - Cython wrapper: [embedded_mproc.pyx](mdc:embedded_mproc.pyx)
  - Build via:
    ```bash
    python build.py embedded_mproc.pyx
    ```
  - Run with:
    ```bash
    ./embedded_mproc
    ```
- `mproc` package sources: [mproc/src/mproc/](mdc:mproc/src/mproc)
  - Main CLI entrypoint: [mproc/src/mproc/main.py](mdc:mproc/src/mproc/main.py)
  - Configuration in [mproc/pyproject.toml](mdc:mproc/pyproject.toml)
- Tests and examples:
  - Feature tests under [tests/](mdc:tests) and [tests/run/](mdc:tests/run)
  - Demos in [Demos/](mdc:Demos)
- Virtual environments:
  - Project venv in [venv/](mdc:venv)
  - Cython self-tests venv in [Cython/.venv/](mdc:Cython/.venv)
